[h2]Build 0.9.3[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]New art for the power suit frame: shaded olive armour plates over a gunmetal frame, a domed helmet with a lit visor and breather grille, striped pauldrons and a glowing power cell housing on the back. Drawn for every body type, facing every direction.
[*]An empty standing suit now has its visor dark, so it is easy to tell from a piloted one.
[*]New "Climb out" button icon and mod preview image.
[/list]
